# Portfolio — Graphic Designer

A personal portfolio website showcasing graphic design, branding, digital graphics, 3D visuals, and motion design projects.

**Live website:** [avokadookan.digital](https://avokadookan.digital/)

## About the project

This project is a responsive portfolio website developed to showcase a graphic designer's work, professional experience, and creative projects.

The website features a clean, minimal interface focused on visual content and user experience.

## Features

- Responsive layout for desktop and mobile devices
- Project gallery with visual previews
- Interactive navigation and sliders
- Multilingual interface
- Contact information and social media links
- Custom domain and HTTPS configuration

## Technologies

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Git & GitHub
- GitHub Pages

## Deployment

The website is hosted using GitHub Pages and connected to a custom domain.

